  "solution": {
    "text": "When cylinder is displaced by an amount x from its meanposition, spring force and upthrust both will increase. Hence,<br />Net restoring force = extra spring force + extra upthrust &nbsp;<br /><br />Or&nbsp;&nbsp; <math><mrow> <mtext>F</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>kx</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>Ax</mtext> <mi>ρ</mi> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br />&nbsp;<br />Or <math> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>k</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mi>ρ</mi> <mtext>Ag</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>M</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>x</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Now,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mtext>f</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mi>π</mi> </mrow> </mfrac> <msqrt> <mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>x</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </msqrt> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math><mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mi>π</mi> </mrow> </mfrac> <msqrt> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>k</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mi>ρ</mi> <mtext>Ag</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>M</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </msqrt> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><u><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0083_9ad44bc55d87.jpg\" /></strong></u>"
  }
